{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年45歲的TVB花旦陳自瑤（Yoyo）近日在熱播台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演的影后「關子盈」，慘被好姊妹接連出賣及陷害，超虐心重頭戲獲得極大迴響，成為熱話！雖然陳自瑤近期忙於為劇集宣傳，但亦積極參與「助農行動」，不同於多數藝人只在直播間「齋講賣貨」，日前她就親自遠赴江西山區果園，幫當地果農擺檔賣橙，得知對方的辛酸史後，更不禁當場眼濕濕落淚，真情流露獲全網大讚！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤（Yoyo）。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199402159440007168546283.jpeg/oIRo611HXWA4770w4qQ1aOFXb3ANKCZfI2coeiNnKHo\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤（Yoyo）。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷好身材。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199402156818436096275643.jpeg/ndh9zZSfMtDA4NkRexQMeHqwYzjir5dHgX2DYIF9g2A\"/><figcaption>大騷好身材。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤在《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演的影后「關子盈」，慘被好姊妹接連出賣及陷害。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196147761301426176576894.png/zBGcwr4BWXKzrQaH5tSjg5cePTQ7McztvyS97r8kve4\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤在《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演的影后「關子盈」，慘被好姊妹接連出賣及陷害。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤為《玫瑰戰爭》落力宣傳。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197931006716809216039542.jpeg/4fLf7oL-eiHSHI1irV473vjw2ngZr612hUVek4VFXpM\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤為《玫瑰戰爭》落力宣傳。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>陳自瑤深入江西山區果園收橙　聞果農辛酸感觸落淚</p><p>陳自瑤上載影片，並寫道：「助農是一件我一直會做的事情」。片中所見，陳自瑤打扮樸素，她透露此行不是賣橙，而是為了收橙，雖然山路崎嶇，但她都親身深入滿山橙樹的果園，與當地一位30多歲的果農小哥交談，她一邊試食新鮮摘下的臍橙，一邊了解當地果農的種植與銷售困境。當聽到果農小哥娓娓道出種橙的艱辛、面臨滯銷與收入微薄的無奈時，感性的陳自瑤都忍不住當場眼濕濕，內心更自責「我真的覺得自己很沒用」、「我真的很想幫助他們」，並安慰對方：「可以的可以的。」</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤打扮樸素，她透露此行不是賣橙，而是為了收橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405078419738624865419.jpeg/FKTdMCJa1YLzDK7Sov0XfzBoXU-StdLEvIibbbyIm20\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤打扮樸素，她透露此行不是賣橙，而是為了收橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"山路崎嶇。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405076129517568326179.jpeg/j8vUlBhs84p9pEJ2MLOR5mmE-OKNEL2G9xYuk_cWLpM\"/><figcaption>山路崎嶇。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"要爬上山。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405110175207424726980.jpeg/C8ZchllGRLh1KELGnPZYQpWWC-5AgxPUNmazZzZms2c\"/><figcaption>要爬上山。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與當地一位30多歲的果農小哥交談。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405107754962944874129.jpeg/ToAneJ_FQU0WxDFxBEtkcjx8EIhq7UTqxoEwlMaBMJQ\"/><figcaption>與當地一位30多歲的果農小哥交談。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辛酸。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405105523462144320469.jpeg/m_Ks65ibndby0M-wEOA-eQfU3we-wVvxiQhETYkIRE0\"/><figcaption>辛酸。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"忍不住眼濕濕。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405103019331584153248.jpeg/B0sXCMdjAbP0TrRmaMQ5JP-KHBbrEC83Z8rEXmfKxF4\"/><figcaption>忍不住眼濕濕。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自責。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405100670390272736528.jpeg/U8Rjjd5hui6yCgr_BLcyA9F3USToWoHbX32Mzl99jM4\"/><figcaption>自責。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"落淚。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405108044500992094817.jpeg/v-OHehL66dCv1oJ7ZSep7RGrRGqJaIH1tTctqbU3Lak\"/><figcaption>落淚。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"安慰果農小哥。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405105758474240394287.jpeg/RWda1v-7wO_zYufHB9C45yxSBHYXe4No-guecvoLnnI\"/><figcaption>安慰果農小哥。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>陳自瑤做義工搬運兼街頭擺檔賣橙　霸氣包底助農落力直播帶貨</p><p>眼見果農小哥年紀輕輕卻承受沉重生活壓力，陳自瑤決定以實際行動相助，她毫不猶豫向對方提出：「既然我來了，我幫你一起去賣果好不好？」雖然對方坦言沒有人工，但陳自瑤就表示：「無所謂啦，不收錢不收錢，義工好嗎？」她不但親力親為採摘及挑選，還與對方合力抬起一箱箱橙搬運上車，更親自跟隨果農到街頭賣橙。面對龐大的貨量，陳自瑤坦言：「我不知道我可以收多少的橙子，我覺得我能收多少就多少，就算最後賣不了這麼多，虧的是我沒關係，但是起碼他們可以賺點錢！」陳自瑤亦落力在直播間賣橙，更附上親筆簽名照，催谷銷量！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤主動提出幫對方賣橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405103434698752349765.jpeg/xIaP01TBKt5QbS51H1MwuXs5PcMgHc1qZSziaGUs4mg\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤主動提出幫對方賣橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唔收錢。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405101274501120610785.jpeg/pI0ju7t_2YnurHbz93j8CflURk5PqtkC7Ir_f-yK_38\"/><figcaption>唔收錢。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搬橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405099160440832829165.jpeg/QI2MShn2VgJp8ccBgZ2HkmzHiWQq_vUuwrsMLMK7DCw\"/><figcaption>搬橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"落力。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405104772943872193206.jpeg/ek2I2dK_p9xYyOYhxxCbDlPIaS749b79Ue3SplHt0qY\"/><figcaption>落力。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺檔賣橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405102419808256018734.jpeg/uQcXOAHpHOfIGRo8gpdq4rfd-E7r76xhPaPfmT2j35k\"/><figcaption>擺檔賣橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺檔賣橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405100192501760804371.jpeg/_VT41lLLBy0kiuQtfXo2hxZlcXvDA58WB7jO8ge4zvI\"/><figcaption>擺檔賣橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"包底。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405098015526912896240.jpeg/a9uMUh5qFdMWk1JXlStDluFiPboOlYnjLswgAS7MIAE\"/><figcaption>包底。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"希望幫到人。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199405095834357760345907.jpeg/1p5FZoW66d4GVAtoyQ6p-I5xbGbU6R0tlJ2oRpSdqEY\"/><figcaption>希望幫到人。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"直播帶貨賣橙。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199401327780958208925704.jpeg/VjavmJVqdnopXr60edVi9tRPn37LD_llyxLSBssS0gY\"/><figcaption>直播帶貨賣橙。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"附送簽名照。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199401325406851072912076.jpeg/-JlQxVy-s9uN1gKlJBvG-YyWSzj5ZzWsDNYsjgzWLI4\"/><figcaption>附送簽名照。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"附送簽名照。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199401323049521152437850.jpeg/mNN6ClIWsFedOOtwhQYQUj-z_rakPf0lBGbe9gRm3vY\"/><figcaption>附送簽名照。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:22:33.699535+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1098,"images":24,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:16:50.790580+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:07.175253+00:00","content_hash":"249fe6935682390760bd3df2b445c3b328a04d7205be7813ce528d332d1b179c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}